Z||000000||fiero56||07-09-2001||11:07 PM||||Buddy and I were talking today, and deicided if I stick around for the weekend and the weather is nice, we should go paintballing. <P>I'm ready, and its only monday. Paintball gets a bad rap ocassionally, but it is the most extreme and exciting sport I have ever played. Plus, since I got rid of all my cammo, I get an exuse to break out the "garage-grunge" to wear.<P>Anyone else here play? I really need to get bck into the sport, I've fallen out in the last few years because it gets so damn expensive. This will be the first time this year for me.||||reg||10
